# A trial's folder keeps what its entrants were given and what it found: its README.md, results.md, spec.md or task.md, briefs,
# build files, assets.txt, and each variant's brief.md, docs/ and starting Main.hx. Entrants' source and folders (<name>.NNN) stay out,
# and so do assets, which live in templates/.
/20*/**
!/20*/**/
!/20*/**/*.md
!/20*/**/*.hxml
!/20*/assets.txt
!/20*/*/docs/**
!/20*/*/Main.hx
/20*/*.[0-9][0-9][0-9]/
/20*/**/assets/
